---
import Mark from './Mark.astro';
import Shot from './Shot.astro';
import icon from '../assets/icon.png';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import { links, version, site } from '../data/site';
---
<section class="section install" id="install" aria-labelledby="install-title" data-surface="dark">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="install-head">
      <h2 id="install-title" class="h2" data-reveal>Free. Download, drag, open.</h2>
      <div class="dl" data-reveal>
        <a class="btn btn-ember btn-lg" href={links.download}>
          Download Cursorlight.dmg
          <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 3.5v11m0 0 4.5-4.5M10 14.5 5.5 10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </a>
        <p class="fine">Version {version}. macOS {site.minimumMacOS} or later. Apple silicon and Intel.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <ol class="steps">
      <li class="step" data-reveal>
        <div class="step-n" aria-hidden="true">1</div>
        <div class="step-body">
          <h3 class="h3">Drag it to Applications.</h3>
          <p>Open the disk image and drag Cursorlight onto the Applications folder.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="dmg" aria-hidden="true">
          <Image src={icon} alt="" width={96} height={96} class="dmg-icon" />
          <svg class="dmg-arrow" viewBox="0 0 120 24" fill="none"><path d="M2 12h108m0 0-9-8m9 8-9 8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-dasharray="2 7"/></svg>
          <svg class="dmg-folder" viewBox="0 0 96 80" fill="none"><path d="M6 14a6 6 0 0 1 6-6h24l8 9h40a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v43a6 6 0 0 1-6 6H12a6 6 0 0 1-6-6z" fill="#3a3548"/><path d="M6 26h84v37a6 6 0 0 1-6 6H12a6 6 0 0 1-6-6z" fill="#4a4460"/></svg>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="step" data-reveal>
        <div class="step-n" aria-hidden="true">2</div>
        <div class="step-body">
          <h3 class="h3">Confirm the first launch.</h3>
          <p>
            Cursorlight is not notarized yet, because there is no Apple Developer account behind it. macOS refuses the first launch and says it
            cannot verify the app. That message is about the missing notarization, not a finding about the app. You confirm once.
          </p>
          <div class="how">
            <div>
              <h4>macOS 15 or later</h4>
              <ol>
                <li>Open Cursorlight from Applications. When the warning appears, click Done. Do not choose Move to Trash.</li>
                <li>Open System Settings, then Privacy &amp; Security, and scroll to Security.</li>
                <li>Click <Mark kind="line" seed={9}>Open Anyway</Mark> next to Cursorlight, confirm with your password or Touch ID, then click Open.</li>
              </ol>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4>macOS 14</h4>
              <ol>
                <li>Control-click Cursorlight in Applications and choose Open.</li>
                <li>Click Open in the dialog.</li>
              </ol>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="term">
            <p>Or, if you trust the source, remove the quarantine flag in Terminal:</p>
            <div class="cmd">
              <code id="xattr-cmd">xattr -dr com.apple.quarantine /Applications/Cursorlight.app</code>
              <button type="button" class="copy" data-copy="#xattr-cmd" aria-label="Copy the Terminal command">Copy</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="step" data-reveal>
        <div class="step-n" aria-hidden="true">3</div>
        <div class="step-body">
          <h3 class="h3">Try it for real.</h3>
          <p>A short welcome makes you shake the mouse, use the laser and draw ink before it finishes. No permission is needed for any of that.</p>
        </div>
        <figure class="welcome-shot"><Shot id="welcome" sizes="(min-width: 1000px) 640px, 92vw" widths={[640, 1280, 2000]} /></figure>
      </li>
    </ol>
    <p class="more" data-reveal>
      Checksums, building from source, updating and uninstalling are in the <a class="link" href={links.install}>install guide</a>.
      Updates are optional: turn on the check in Settings, About.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
